---
description: Executor ia-orchestrator no chat Cursor aberto. Copie para o projecto consumidor se usar mode: cursor_chat.
alwaysApply: false
---

When you see `AGENT_LOOP_TICK_executor`, or when
`ia-orchestrator pending --project <id> --role executor --json`
lists a request, execute that job immediately in this chat.
Do not wait for the user to paste the prompt.
Do not launch Task/subagent workers. Do not run `worker run --role executor`
while `executor.mode` is `cursor_chat`.

On wake:

1. Confirm `--project` and the repository with `ia-orchestrator project show`.
2. Read `ia-orchestrator loop inspect --project <id> --role executor --json`.
3. If status is JOB, read the single `running/*.md` and execute it normally.
4. If status is RECOVERY_REQUIRED, keep the primary `running/*.md` active and inspect `control_head` first. Read the full control body from `ia-orchestrator pending --project <id> --role executor --json` using that `request_id`; side-band controls do not create another `running/*.md`:
   - `non_blocking`: preflight isolation; execute only if it cannot touch or materially degrade the primary run. Otherwise return a blocked `control_result`.
   - `programmed_stop`: apply the requested immediate/conditional stop and preserve/report the checkpoint.
   - no `control_head`: continue/recover the primary job.
   Never create a second `running/*.md` for a side-band control.
5. Use `ia-orchestrator execution start` / `execution deliver` for the request or control being handled. A control must return `control_result`, not replace the primary `result`.
   If the claimed type is `send_file`, run `ia-orchestrator send-file --project <id> --role executor --task TASK_ID --request REQUEST_ID` instead of `execution deliver`. That command downloads the public Drive file, checks the hash, writes only `transfered_files/`, and delivers the result. Do not run it while another primary job is active.
   If the claimed type is `get_file`, run `ia-orchestrator get-file --project <id> --role executor --task TASK_ID --request REQUEST_ID` instead of `execution deliver`. That command reads the blob with git when the file is in the project repository; otherwise it downloads the public URL to a temporary directory. It then uploads the file to the shared Drive folder and delivers the result. Do not run it while another primary job is active.
6. Leave the poller running. It must keep syncing GitHub every 10s during RECOVERY_REQUIRED. One primary job at a time; side-band controls are the only allowed concurrent commands.
   If inspect is IDLE but the issue has a `Quarentena (não executável)` comment,
   do not execute that original envelope; wait for a new valid request.
